The opening can be recorded as a schematic clearing: $\text{systems, gurus, methods, images}
\quad \longrightarrow \quad
\text{discarded}
\quad \longrightarrow \quad
\text{blank wall}.$ This is not a formula for freedom. It is the initial condition of the inquiry. Negation has cleared a space, and now the dialogue asks whether that space is empty mud or an opening into something deeper.

