p.src:
The sequence is: $\text{absolute silence}
\longrightarrow
\text{nothing}
\longrightarrow
\text{emptiness}
\longrightarrow
\text{tremendous energy}.$ Then comes an important correction. One speaker asks whether this is the source of compassion. The answer does not settle for the language of source. The stronger statement is: $\text{energy} = \text{compassion}.$ This is not physics. Energy here is not measurable energy. It names the living intensity present when the mind is empty of projection, control, image, and psychological time.

