\longrightarrow
\text{intelligence}
\longrightarrow
\text{compassion}
\longrightarrow
\text{sacred}.$ The last arrow is delicate. The sacred is not an object reached by a procedure. Krishnamurti says that a living thing cannot be examined as a dead thing. The arrow is therefore a reading aid, not a method.

